        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ringo Starr, Ian Hunter, Paul Barrere, Howard Jones, Roger Hodgson, Sheila E, Mick Ronson, Mark Rivera\n- Organizations: Ringo Starr and Friends, Mott the Hoople, Little Feat\n- Songs: \"Ride Like the Wind\"\n\nFacts:\n- Ian Hunter was a member of Mott the Hoople and performed in Ringo Starr and Friends.\n- Paul Barrere was a member of Little Feat.\n- The song \"Ride Like the Wind\" was dedicated to Paul Barrere.\n- Ian Hunter was born on 3 June 1939.\n- Paul Barrere was born on 3 July 1948.\n- Howard Jones, Roger Hodgson, Sheila E, Mick Ronson, and Mark Rivera were also in Ringo Starr and Friends.",
